{"title":"Mother of Moths","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 45 Moth that attacks with stab (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">slash</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">crush</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">shock</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/moonwing-dust\">Moonwing Dust</a> <span class=\"muted\">(infuses an enchant)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Enchanter’s Table</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/moon-mother\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/moon-mother?lv=45\">Lv 45 <span>4</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/moon-mother?lv=58\">Lv 58 <span>83</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/moon-mother?lv=59\">Lv 59 <span>24</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/moon-mother?lv=60\">Lv 60 <span>26</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/moon-mother?lv=45\" title=\"Pick level 45\"><td><b>45</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>243</td><td>29.3</td><td>2,250</td><td class=\"muted\">729 · 41 · 6,750</td><td>4</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/moon-mother?lv=58\" title=\"Pick level 58\"><td><b>58</b></td><td>423</td><td>36.4</td><td>2,900</td><td class=\"muted\">1,269 · 51 · 8,700</td><td>83</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/moon-mother\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>59</b></td><td>440</td><td>37</td><td>2,950</td><td class=\"muted\">1,320 · 51.8 · 8,850</td><td>24</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/moon-mother?lv=60\" title=\"Pick level 60\"><td><b>60</b></td><td>455</td><td>37.5</td><td>3,000</td><td class=\"muted\">1,365 · 52.5 · 9,000</td><td>26</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 7 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 7 recorded drops, 1,257 total, 117–256 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×117–256</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"moth-silk\" title=\"Moth Silk - in 5 of 7 looted corpses, 5 recorded drops, 10 total, 1–4 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/0d15d8530734f756ad4c.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Moth Silk</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.4<br>×1–4</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"luna-wing\" title=\"Luna Wing - in 3 of 7 looted corpses, 3 recorded drops, 3 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/9dfc6bd97d5a343b2a88.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Luna Wing</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/2<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gem-ruby\" title=\"Gem Ruby - in 3 of 7 looted corpses, 3 recorded drops, 3 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/c3be065d1945333c2808.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gem Ruby</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/2<br>×1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+12 more\">+12 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"silverhide-arms\" title=\"Silverhide Arms - in 1 of 7 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/74ad12c317066662bc3e.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Silverhide Arms</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/7<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Superior: 1 of 1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"silverhide-head\" title=\"Silverhide Head - in 1 of 7 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/d5250e2dda1660455a50.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Silverhide Head</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/7<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Excellent: 1 of 1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"glimmerfox-torso\" title=\"Glimmerfox Torso - in 1 of 7 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/e3acb385ca730fffe65e.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Glimmerfox Torso</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/7<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Excellent: 1 of 1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gem-emerald\" title=\"Gem Emerald - in 1 of 7 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/5b18953b87dfb910ebaa.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gem Emerald</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/7<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"health-potion-large\" title=\"Health Potion Large - in 1 of 7 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/752437a6ecea30afa5ec.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Health Potion Large</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/7<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gravewrap-arms\" title=\"Gravewrap Arms - in 1 of 7 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/12067670c90381512ea9.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gravewrap Arms</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/7<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Excellent: 1 of 1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"titanium-kryss\" title=\"Titanium Kryss - in 1 of 7 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/59f833ee7c52ee8c1c91.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Titanium Kryss</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/7<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gem-pearl\" title=\"Gem Pearl - in 1 of 7 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/a8e7d0e0c97b577cea1a.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gem Pearl</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/7<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"titanium-warmace\" title=\"Titanium Warmace - in 1 of 7 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/f5b94ca540b372a2bcf4.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Titanium Warmace</s